--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,3 +1,13 @@
+# Thinspace Persistent — custom build 2026102801
+
+Based on Thinspace 1.2.2, commit `9a2ab018a8656c5a086b375de07b553484dba954`.
+
+- Settings → Chat Bar → Keep Chat Bar Visible defaults on; turn it off to restore click-away dismissal.
+- Hidden ordinary sessions stay loaded for two hours; detected private/Temporary Chats are exempt from automatic idle unloading.
+- The webpage fills the floating window edge to edge: no header, glass rim, extra margins, or overlaid controls. Hold Command+Option and drag anywhere to move it. Command+Shift+Return or the menu bar opens the full window. Work and other webpage buttons stay unobstructed.
+- Option+Space, Command+Shift+N, and provider storage retain the upstream implementation.
+- Retention applies while Thinspace is running. Quitting, switching providers, explicit navigation/reload, website timeouts, and WebKit/macOS process termination can still end or reload a page. Thinspace does not send keep-alive messages or save private conversations to disk.
+
 # Thinspace
 
 **Big AI. Very little app.**
